## 1. Purpose and when to run

Find the AI tools actually in use at {{org_name}} (including shadow AI: unsanctioned tools, personal accounts, undeclared AI-assisted changes) and reconcile them with the software inventory, so that every QMS-relevant tool is registered, validated or stopped{{#reg_iso13485}} (ISO 13485:2016 clauses 4.1.6 and 7.4){{/reg_iso13485}}. Run it before a validation plan is approved{{#already_in_use}} (and as part of the interim-use justification){{/already_in_use}}, at every periodic review (every {{periodic_review_months}} months), and on a trigger: a new AI vendor invoice, a new app or bot on the code host, or a report under {{doc_id_wi}}.

